<p>You go all out, trying to burn down your foes as fast as possible.</p><p>You gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+10%, +13%, +15%, +18%, +20%</acronym> attack speed, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100,<br>Dexterity 100">+12%, +16%, +19%, +21%, +23%</acronym> critical chance and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100,<br>Dexterity 100">+24%, +28%, +31%, +33%, +35%</acronym> physical resistance penetration, but this talent drains 6 stamina each turn.</p><p>This effect is disabled automatically on rest or run.</p><p></p>